{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "どっちも買いませんでした\n前にも似たようなことがあって、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こういうとき、２つとも買えば済む話？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "迷うってことは\n本当はどっち欲しくないってことらしい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どこでどうやって知ったか覚えてないけど、何かに迷うときいつも思い出す言葉"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "迷いながら頭で"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ああー、今自分は本当は、\n本当はどっちも欲しくないんだ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みたいにメタで見ようとして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お家に帰りながら後悔する"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当って何だろう、、やれやれだ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に両方欲しいことだってあるよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あるよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mob2riZy2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "プリン大好きな人が美味しいってうプリンと\nプリン別に好きじゃない人がこれは美味しいっていうプリン\nどっちが美味しんだろうね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分以外のみんなが美味しいっていうプリンと\n自分だけが美味しいと思うプリン\nどっちが美味しんだろうね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんなの決まってるね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分が食べてみて\n自分が美味しいと思った方が\n自分にとって美味しい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気が合うのは同じプリンを美味しいと思った人？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "違うプリンを選んだ人との方が喧嘩にならないかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "好きが一緒なのとか\n好きじゃないが一緒なのとか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "発覚したときちょっと嬉しい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "理由も一緒だとさらに嬉しい〜♩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美味しいも美味しくないも\n好きも好きじゃないも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "受け取る方が決めることで、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一つの受け取り方があれば\nその反対の受け取り方も必ずあるから"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だからどんなプリンも\n誰かにとって美味しいプリン 🍮"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色んな味が並ぶ中で\nサラリーマンさん迷わずプレーン買ってた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大人っぽい、、！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobmu8Fop.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "迷ってると、その一瞬の選択でその先の全てが決まってしまう気持ちになるけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どれ選んだって後悔しないことなんて無い気がしてきます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "折衷案を編み出したり\nどこか我慢したり妥協したりして\nなんとか選んで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでもやってみたら結局ちょっと後悔しちゃって\n知ることがある"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "後悔しない選択をしないとって思うと\n決めるまでちょーっとお時間ください〜〜ってなるけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "結局どれ選んでもどこかしらで後悔するって知ってたら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "選んだ後が大事なんだなぁって思えてくるかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "選んでみて、思ってたのと違ったときは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人生のスパイス頂戴しましたって\n煮込むことにしてる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうしてスパイスを煮込む話になったのかきかれても答えられない"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "答えがないものの説明は難しい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobyiMoEJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "天の神様の言う通りでもなんでも良いから\nどっちかのプリンを買えばよかったってことか〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大胆に両方買ってもよかったかもしれない"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "後悔、後悔なスーパーの帰り道です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どっちも買ったとしたら\n次はどっちから食べるかで迷うか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんなの目瞑って選びなさいよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みたいなどうでもいいこと考えられるくらい素敵な気温で\nスキップしてやろうかと思いました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "保育園の子供達と先生とすれ違って\n1人スキップしてる子がいて可愛かった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "子供達がペアで手繋いで整列してて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その子と手を繋いでる子もされるがままで\n腕ぐわんぐわんされててかわいかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "子供のとき好きだったやつが同じだった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大人になっても楽しかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobRLb5fY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "行きたいと思ってから、季節2つくらい変わったね\n行けて良かった〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色んなこと考えてて\n遠くを見てた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "から一緒に見てみたけど\n答えが分からなかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "話しながら、\n今ありのままで素敵だってことを伝えたくて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分の経験とか持ってる言葉とか\nかき集めてデッキ組んでみたけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どんな感じ？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いい相手になれてたかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobRtcrHI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色んなことを考えてる目がきれい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こういうときどうやって考えてますかってきいてくれて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobL6hYmV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobRyRouF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しばらく一緒に話しながら\n目の光が増えていくのが隣で見てて分かって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵な目だなあって思いました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まっすぐな目で栄養があるものをたくさん見て"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "霞みそうなときはいつでも晴らしてみせたいですね、という気持ちです⛅️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mob8VFB0y.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "話そうか迷った時は、話さないって決めてました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "話してみたいなって、変化したのは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "受け取ってもらえた経験からくる\n安心感のおかげか〜 ˖*"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "否定せずに聞いてくれただけでも嬉しいのに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "相手も同等の自己開示をしてくれたときなんて\nたまらなく嬉しくなるね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも受け取ってくれてありがとう୨୧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "伝えるのに勇気が要ることも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勇気を出して伝えて良かったなあ〜って気持ちにさせてくれるような受け取り方をしてくれるから"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "伝えたくなる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "伝えてくれてありがとうなんて、優しすぎるよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こちらが、こちらこそ伝えさせてくれてありがとうの気持ち"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎日見てくれてありがとう 💌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/moblP8CLz.jpg", "alt": ""}], "source": "official"}